  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Bring a medium saucepan of salted water to the boil. Peel potato and cut into large chunks.\n• Cook potato in the boiling water until easily pierced with a fork, 12-15 minutes. Drain and return to the pan.\n• Add the butter and milk to potato and season generously with salt. Mash until smooth.\n• TIP: Save time and get more fibre by leaving the potato unpeeled.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f837f4cade9b9f0acdcada/step-9d588000.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While potato is cooking, preheat grill to high.\n• Finely chop garlic, carrot and brown onion.\n• Drain and rinse cannellini beans.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook carrot and onion, stirring occasionally, until softened, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add cannellini beans, garlic & herb seasoning and half the garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f837f4cade9b9f0acdcada/step-865cad10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Stir in light cooking cream, vegetable stock and the water and simmer until thickened, 2-3 minutes.\n• Remove from heat and stir in baby spinach leaves until just wilted. Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f837f4cade9b9f0acdcada/step-7e411820.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Transfer bean filling to a baking dish and spread mashed potato over the top.\n• Sprinkle with Cheddar cheese. Grill until golden, 5-10 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f837f4cade9b9f0acdcada/step-0aa66230.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While pie is grilling, wipe out frying pan and return to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook broccoli florets until tender, 5-6 minutes.\n• Add remaining garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute. Season to taste.\n• TIP: Add a dash of water to the pan to help speed up the cooking process.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f837f4cade9b9f0acdcada/step-8d3ceb40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide creamy Italian white bean pie and garlicky broccoli between plates.\n• Sprinkle over flaked almonds to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f837f4cade9b9f0acdcada/step-52326c50.jpg"
    }
  ]
